{
  "name": "Nairobi OS · 99 Error Handler",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2400,
        0
      ],
      "id": "w9-n01-error-trigger",
      "name": "Al fallar cualquier workflow",
      "notes": "Configurar en Settings → Error Workflow de W1, W2, W3, W4, W5, W6, W7, W8 cuando cada uno se importe. n8n invoca este workflow automáticamente pasando datos del error (workflow, ejecución, nodo, mensaje)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "insert into public.system_errors (workflow_name, execution_id, node_name, error_message, payload)\nvalues ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5::jsonb)\nreturning id;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.workflow?.name, $json.execution?.id, $json.execution?.lastNodeExecuted, $json.execution?.error?.message || 'sin mensaje', JSON.stringify($json.execution?.error || {}).slice(0, 8000)] }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        -2160,
        0
      ],
      "id": "w9-n02-registrar-error",
      "name": "Registrar en system_errors",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "ZOSqufG8JPOkyMXX",
          "name": "Supabase Postgrest"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "u1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.workflow?.name }}",
              "rightValue": "01 Ingesta WhatsApp|02 Cerebro Nai|04 Registro de Siniestros|05 Escalación",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -1920,
        0
      ],
      "id": "w9-n03-if-urgente",
      "name": "¿Workflow de cara al cliente?",
      "notes": "Los errores en los workflows que tocan directamente al cliente (ingesta, cerebro, siniestros, escalación) son de alta prioridad — el cliente puede estar esperando respuesta. Errores en cron/reportes son de prioridad normal (se leen en system_errors, no despiertan a nadie)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://evolution-api:8080/message/sendText/nairobi-os",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ number: ($json.alert_phone || '').toString().replace(/\\D/g, ''), text: '⚠️ Nairobi OS — error en ' + ($('Al fallar cualquier workflow').item.json.workflow?.name || 'workflow desconocido') + ': ' + ($('Al fallar cualquier workflow').item.json.execution?.error?.message || 'sin detalle').toString().slice(0, 300) }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1680,
        -120
      ],
      "id": "w9-n04-alertar-sebastian",
      "name": "Alertar a Sebastián (Evolution)",
      "notes": "Migrado de WaAPI a Evolution API v2 el 2026-08-23 (R014). Endpoint /message/sendText/{instancia}, body {number, text} — el número va en dígitos, sin @c.us. Credencial 'Evolution API saliente' (header apikey). JSON.stringify evita romper el body con comillas o saltos de línea.",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "SnHjtoJOJ0HG2mCe",
          "name": "Evolution API saliente"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1680,
        120
      ],
      "id": "w9-n05-solo-registrar",
      "name": "Solo registrado (fin)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "select value #>> '{}' as alert_phone\nfrom public.settings where key = 'emergency_contact_phone';",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        -1800,
        -120
      ],
      "id": "w9-n03b-obtener-numero-alerta",
      "name": "Obtener número de alerta",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "ZOSqufG8JPOkyMXX",
          "name": "Supabase Postgrest"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Reemplaza $vars.SEBASTIAN_ALERT_CHAT_ID (variable inexistente). Mismo origen que W5/W7: public.settings.emergency_contact_phone.",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
